3 hours and 26 minutes

00:06:01.152 --> 00:06:03.946
into the space walk byt Cassada and Rubio

00:06:03.946 --> 00:06:07.784
An astronaut has to deal
with a huge amount of problems on Mars,

00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:11.996
like radiation,
massive temperature changes, exposure

00:06:11.996 --> 00:06:15.875
to dust and other contaminants, changes
in the nervous system.

00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:19.128
There's lower gravity,
which can cause what they call

00:06:19.128 --> 00:06:22.423
a puffy face chicken legs syndrome.

00:06:22.757 --> 00:06:26.677
Yes, that's what the that's what
